{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2021-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1612137600, "end_date": 1612742399, "month_true_total": 1162, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:48:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "86171893", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071838954", "personaname": "Hypno", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071838954/", "num_games_owned": 670, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 10584, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4039, "last_played": 1785718962, "avatar": "bb3ef3a7103423dbfe4947ad72c6a43a84b53fa9"}, "language": "english", "review": "For being a game in Early Access this is one of the most polished games I have seen recently. This game is, in layman's terms, Hades with Borderlands gun play. One of my friends even called it Aim Labs with augments. The game has so much replay-ability from collecting all 45 guns in the game, unlocking all the scrolls in the game, unlocking the different characters, and beating the game with varying difficulty. Of course I have not even scratched the surface because its more fun to look for your self.\n\nI easily recommend this game to people who are fans of shooters, rouge likes, and to people who are just getting into these genres", "timestamp_created": 1612741546, "timestamp_updated": 1612741546, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "86171798", "author": {"steamid": "76561198853355462", "personaname": "MeLoNpaBLo", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198853355462/", "num_games_owned": 73, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 2261, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 562, "last_played": 1750019174, "avatar": "cc130acc9824b021a853765085d7eff788b524cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "good                             game", "timestamp_created": 1612741380, "timestamp_updated": 1612741380, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "86170724", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991222970", "personaname": "CDizzle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/smeeg126/", "num_games_owned": 495, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 15375, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1985, "last_played": 1784668640, "avatar": "3924aafd2abaa6fbea07ba5939bd1f3ee90a835e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game to play with friends.  If you're solo not so much fun.  Rounds take about a hour if you go all the way.", "timestamp_created": 1612739621, "timestamp_updated": 1612739621, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "86167348", "author": {"steamid": "76561198136311219", "personaname": "Nicle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Nicle_93/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 1483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1287, "last_played": 1613448724, "avatar": "39148b81df3b6013cac3d09b303b6f2dcbc7c5d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its fun.", "timestamp_created": 1612734954, "timestamp_updated": 1612734954, "voted_up": true, "votes_up